{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f98072d15fe7b49a","name":"Droid Command Station","source":{"id":"source:reference-f98072d15fe7b49a","title":"Droid Command Station","revision":21021,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:00:34Z","sha256":"a55d5a15030cc92abdc65a3c6209a944d72667c486d5e0ee7aa2f1740d87ef2f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21021","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Droid%20Command%20Station&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f98072d15fe7b49a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 10,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1,000 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["On ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," and at other installations requiring a large ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," population, centralized Droid Command Stations direct and control ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," as they carry out their daily operations. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," or an organic overseer can operate the Droid Command Station. On large ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," or major facilities, the Droid Command Station is manned at all hours. Smaller operations might use the Droid Command Station to issue commands and to provide automated oversight.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," in the command station's Pool must have a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlink","referenceId":"reference:609e72c37493843f"},", an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Internal Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Internal_Comlink","referenceId":"reference:7fadfdfea7aba7e9"},", or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Remote Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Remote_Processor","referenceId":"reference:d46ac6dda5384866"}," in order to maintain contact with the Droid Command Station. Accessing the station requires the appropriate password or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Code Cylinder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Code_Cylinder","referenceId":"reference:e8825fcee2d6d69f"},". The Droid Command Station typically has an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," score of 14 (or the ship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"},", whichever is higher) and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," of 15. Standard Droid Command Stations provide the following functions with the indicated ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check: \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Issue a routine command to order a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," in the Droid Pool to carry out a specific task. If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," is familiar with the task, or if the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the associated ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"},", no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," is required. If the command is unusual or highly specific, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check might be required at the Gamemaster's discretion. The user gains a +10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks against the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},". Commands can be issued verbally or by keypad."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Coordinate multiple ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," in the Pool, enabling them to complete tasks more efficiently. With a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check by the station operator, each ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," aiding in a given task provides a +3 bonus instead of a +2 bonus and automatically succeeds on checks to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Locate any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," in the Droid Pool anywhere within the station's operational range- typically the vessel or facility where the Droid Command Station is installed. The target ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," must be fitted with a tracking device or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restraining Bolt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restraining_Bolt","referenceId":"reference:f385e818f02da932"}," that can be tracked by station's sensors or the facility's security network. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check of DC 5 is sufficient to locate any such ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Receive detailed information about a Droid's status, including current ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", position on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", and the operational condition of its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Systems"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Accessories"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Accessories"},". No check is required."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reprogram"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reprogram"}," a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," in the Pool by remote or direct connection to the Droid Command Station."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Translate between ",{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"}," and common ",{"tag":"a","children":["Languages"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Languages","referenceId":"reference:318655cea4bd2096"},". No check is required."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
